    {
      "id": "claim_e78c421443b04a729e5de7f328cad25b",
      "statement": "dsh-session provides the append-only session log as the single source of truth every model-visible fact flows through: LLM message history is derived from the log (deriveMessages()), never stored separately, surface events must declare how they join the ordered surface, and persistence backends subscribe to session/event and flush on session/flush.",
