    {
      "id": "claim_6a2256d463e5439096fcac1ac48b3110",
      "statement": "dsh-agent-loop creates agents (fresh or resumed from persisted history) and runs the turn and step lifecycle; as the default driver it implements the Agent interface from dsh-agent and registers its factory on ctx.agents, and it is the harness's only concrete loop — everything beyond 'call the model, run the tools, repeat' belongs to plugins listening on the event taxonomy.",
      "evidence": [
