    {
      "id": "claim_17cd35ab9d7a4a4bb23069818eeb47ab",
      "statement": "Durable replay facts live on session/event while live control and status live on agent/*; SDK users that need replayable transcript data consume session/event while agent/* is the live coordination API for queue/status, prompt interception, request construction, steering, continuation, and errors.",
